  "bodyHash": "2b3774adbbd0945f",
  "content": "\n\n<p><strong>下界深淵升級是一款小型模組，為下界的熔岩海中增添了額外的動植物。總共新增了九種魚類、一種新附魔以及一種藥水，讓你能夠更好地探索下界的熔岩。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>前置模組</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Geckolib 3.0&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>最新更新新增了數種魚類與一種新型玻璃，讓你可以在熔岩中保持視野，製作各種熔岩魚缸吧 :)</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UHJWXOX.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"200\"><br></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>熔岩釣魚</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SF98U0S.png\" width=\"366\" height=\"177\"></p>\n<p><strong>本模組新增了於熔岩中釣魚的功能（支援主世界與下界）</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>新增魚種</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N6iiT9P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"135\"></p>\n<p><strong>噬魂魚</strong>：生息於靈魂沙谷，可用來製作精美的靴子&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fae924H.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"195\"></p>\n<p><strong>凋靈骨魚</strong>：生息於靈魂沙谷</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Exudvdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"162\"></p>\n<p><strong>骨魚</strong>：生息於下界廢墟</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oJeUZib.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"202\"></p>\n<p><strong>焦灼鱈魚</strong>：生息於下界廢墟</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hcreNrT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"117\"></p>\n<p><strong>螢光鰉魚</strong>：生息於深紅森林</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sAbvkG2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"143\"></p>\n<p><strong>熔岩河豚</strong>：生息於扭曲森林，可用來調製新藥水</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ve2oOl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"180\"></p>\n<p><strong>黑曜石魚</strong>：生息於玄武岩三角洲</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WIV121c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"212\"></p>\n<p><strong>熔岩史萊姆魚</strong>：生息於玄武岩三角洲<span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/njPA4vm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"190\"></p>\n<p><strong>烈焰魚</strong>：生息於下界要塞區塊</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>深淵區域也會生成能吸收熔岩的海綿，將其放置在水中便會恢復乾燥狀態</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jfTxh71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"662\" height=\"454\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>深淵同樣會生成礦脈噴口，其周圍會湧現優質礦石<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SW1k1tv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"482\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<pre>如需提供建議、回報錯誤或與作者及其他玩家交流，歡迎加入下方的 Discord 伺服器！</pre>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/az7B3Y6UPW\" rel=\"nofollow\">立即加入我們的 Discord 伺服器！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KB9kRYV.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
